WEBVTT

00:12:30.763 --> 00:12:32.297
"Yes.

00:12:32.297 --> 00:12:35.030
You're creating the experience
that you want to have.

00:12:35.063 --> 00:12:37.463
You're designing how you say goodbye."

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.297
She took my hand and said,

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.597
"You understand."

00:12:44.063 --> 00:12:47.697
The next visit to her oncologist
was her last one.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:51.063
What started as a small cluster
in one vertebrae

00:12:51.097 --> 00:12:52.897
expanded throughout her spine

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:56.663
and pushed its way forward
into her sternum and her rib cage.

00:12:56.663 --> 00:12:58.563
All within four months.

00:12:59.197 --> 00:13:01.263
This time there was no begging.